IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `coa-core`
IMPORT `coa29-sch6`

-- coa29-tests-sch6.l4: tests for coa29-sch6.l4 (Schedule 6: meaning of "subsidiary" etc: supplementary provisions).
-- Generated by work/gen_tests_sch6.py. Every expected value is written by hand from the text of the Schedule, beside the case; none is
-- copied from the encoding's output. Quote lines live in the module, not here.


§§ `Para 2: voting rights in a company`

-- Para 2: the rights conferred on shareholders in respect of their shares (or, for a company with no share capital, on members) to vote at general meetings on all, or substantially all, matters.
-- a company with a share capital; shareholders' rights in respect of shares; general meetings; all or substantially all matters
#ASSERT (`sch 6 para 2 the rights are voting rights in the company` WITH `the company has a share capital` IS TRUE, `the rights are conferred on shareholders in respect of their shares` IS TRUE, `the rights are conferred on members` IS FALSE, `the rights are to vote at general meetings of the company` IS TRUE, `the rights are to vote on all, or substantially all, matters` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- as above but the votes are only on some matters
#ASSERT (`sch 6 para 2 the rights are voting rights in the company` WITH `the company has a share capital` IS TRUE, `the rights are conferred on shareholders in respect of their shares` IS TRUE, `the rights are conferred on members` IS FALSE, `the rights are to vote at general meetings of the company` IS TRUE, `the rights are to vote on all, or substantially all, matters` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- as above but the rights are not to vote at general meetings
#ASSERT (`sch 6 para 2 the rights are voting rights in the company` WITH `the company has a share capital` IS TRUE, `the rights are conferred on shareholders in respect of their shares` IS TRUE, `the rights are conferred on members` IS FALSE, `the rights are to vote at general meetings of the company` IS FALSE, `the rights are to vote on all, or substantially all, matters` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- a company with a share capital: rights conferred on members who are not shareholders in respect of their shares
#ASSERT (`sch 6 para 2 the rights are voting rights in the company` WITH `the company has a share capital` IS TRUE, `the rights are conferred on shareholders in respect of their shares` IS FALSE, `the rights are conferred on members` IS TRUE, `the rights are to vote at general meetings of the company` IS TRUE, `the rights are to vote on all, or substantially all, matters` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- a company with no share capital: rights conferred on members
#ASSERT (`sch 6 para 2 the rights are voting rights in the company` WITH `the company has a share capital` IS FALSE, `the rights are conferred on shareholders in respect of their shares` IS FALSE, `the rights are conferred on members` IS TRUE, `the rights are to vote at general meetings of the company` IS TRUE, `the rights are to vote on all, or substantially all, matters` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- a company with no share capital: rights conferred on 'shareholders in respect of shares' are not the case the text names
#ASSERT (`sch 6 para 2 the rights are voting rights in the company` WITH `the company has a share capital` IS FALSE, `the rights are conferred on shareholders in respect of their shares` IS TRUE, `the rights are conferred on members` IS FALSE, `the rights are to vote at general meetings of the company` IS TRUE, `the rights are to vote on all, or substantially all, matters` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE

§§ `Para 3: the right to appoint or remove a majority of the directors`

-- Para 3(1): directors holding a majority of the voting rights at meetings of the board on all, or substantially all, matters. A majority is more than half.
-- 3 of 4 votes
#ASSERT (`sch 6 para 3(1) the right is a right to appoint or remove a majority of the board of directors` WITH `the votes at meetings of the board held by the directors the right is a right to appoint or remove` IS 3, `all the votes at meetings of the board` IS 4, `the votes at meetings of the board are on all, or substantially all, matters` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- 2 of 4 votes: exactly half is not a majority
#ASSERT (`sch 6 para 3(1) the right is a right to appoint or remove a majority of the board of directors` WITH `the votes at meetings of the board held by the directors the right is a right to appoint or remove` IS 2, `all the votes at meetings of the board` IS 4, `the votes at meetings of the board are on all, or substantially all, matters` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- 1 of 1 vote
#ASSERT (`sch 6 para 3(1) the right is a right to appoint or remove a majority of the board of directors` WITH `the votes at meetings of the board held by the directors the right is a right to appoint or remove` IS 1, `all the votes at meetings of the board` IS 1, `the votes at meetings of the board are on all, or substantially all, matters` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- 3 of 5 votes
#ASSERT (`sch 6 para 3(1) the right is a right to appoint or remove a majority of the board of directors` WITH `the votes at meetings of the board held by the directors the right is a right to appoint or remove` IS 3, `all the votes at meetings of the board` IS 5, `the votes at meetings of the board are on all, or substantially all, matters` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- 2 of 5 votes
#ASSERT (`sch 6 para 3(1) the right is a right to appoint or remove a majority of the board of directors` WITH `the votes at meetings of the board held by the directors the right is a right to appoint or remove` IS 2, `all the votes at meetings of the board` IS 5, `the votes at meetings of the board are on all, or substantially all, matters` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- 3 of 4 votes, but not on all or substantially all matters
#ASSERT (`sch 6 para 3(1) the right is a right to appoint or remove a majority of the board of directors` WITH `the votes at meetings of the board held by the directors the right is a right to appoint or remove` IS 3, `all the votes at meetings of the board` IS 4, `the votes at meetings of the board are on all, or substantially all, matters` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- no votes at meetings of the board at all
#ASSERT (`sch 6 para 3(1) the right is a right to appoint or remove a majority of the board of directors` WITH `the votes at meetings of the board held by the directors the right is a right to appoint or remove` IS 0, `all the votes at meetings of the board` IS 0, `the votes at meetings of the board are on all, or substantially all, matters` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Para 3(2): treated as having the right to appoint if (a) the appointment follows necessarily from appointment as director of the company, or (b) the directorship is held by the company itself.
-- limb (a)
#ASSERT (`sch 6 para 3(2) the company is treated as having the right to appoint to the directorship` WITH `a person's appointment to the directorship follows necessarily from his appointment as director of the company` IS TRUE, `the directorship is held by the company itself` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- limb (b)
#ASSERT (`sch 6 para 3(2) the company is treated as having the right to appoint to the directorship` WITH `a person's appointment to the directorship follows necessarily from his appointment as director of the company` IS FALSE, `the directorship is held by the company itself` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- neither limb (an unmet 'if': marginal reading (a))
#ASSERT (`sch 6 para 3(2) the company is treated as having the right to appoint to the directorship` WITH `a person's appointment to the directorship follows necessarily from his appointment as director of the company` IS FALSE, `the directorship is held by the company itself` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Para 3(3): a right exercisable only with another person's consent is left out of account unless no other person has a right to appoint or remove for that directorship.
-- not a consent-only right: the sub-paragraph does not speak to it
#ASSERT (`sch 6 para 3(3) the right is taken into account` WITH `the right is exercisable only with the consent or concurrence of another person` IS FALSE, `no other person has a right to appoint or, as the case may be, remove in relation to that directorship` IS FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
-- consent-only, and no other person has a right
#ASSERT (`sch 6 para 3(3) the right is taken into account` WITH `the right is exercisable only with the consent or concurrence of another person` IS TRUE, `no other person has a right to appoint or, as the case may be, remove in relation to that directorship` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- consent-only, and another person has a right: left out of account
#ASSERT (`sch 6 para 3(3) the right is taken into account` WITH `the right is exercisable only with the consent or concurrence of another person` IS TRUE, `no other person has a right to appoint or, as the case may be, remove in relation to that directorship` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE

§§ `Para 4: rights exercisable only in certain circumstances or temporarily incapable of exercise`

-- Para 4(1): rights exercisable only in certain circumstances are taken into account only (a) when the circumstances have arisen and for so long as they continue, or (b) when the circumstances are within the control of the person having them. Para 4(2): rights normally exercisable but temporarily incapable continue to be taken into account.
-- conditional rights; the circumstances have arisen and continue (limb (a))
#ASSERT (`sch 6 para 4 the rights are taken into account` WITH `the rights are exercisable only in certain circumstances` IS TRUE, `the circumstances have arisen and continue to obtain` IS TRUE, `the circumstances are within the control of the person having the rights` IS FALSE, `the rights are normally exercisable but are temporarily incapable of exercise` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- conditional rights; within the control of the holder (limb (b))
#ASSERT (`sch 6 para 4 the rights are taken into account` WITH `the rights are exercisable only in certain circumstances` IS TRUE, `the circumstances have arisen and continue to obtain` IS FALSE, `the circumstances are within the control of the person having the rights` IS TRUE, `the rights are normally exercisable but are temporarily incapable of exercise` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- conditional rights; neither: not taken into account
#ASSERT (`sch 6 para 4 the rights are taken into account` WITH `the rights are exercisable only in certain circumstances` IS TRUE, `the circumstances have arisen and continue to obtain` IS FALSE, `the circumstances are within the control of the person having the rights` IS FALSE, `the rights are normally exercisable but are temporarily incapable of exercise` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- normally exercisable but temporarily incapable (sub-paragraph (2))
#ASSERT (`sch 6 para 4 the rights are taken into account` WITH `the rights are exercisable only in certain circumstances` IS FALSE, `the circumstances have arisen and continue to obtain` IS FALSE, `the circumstances are within the control of the person having the rights` IS FALSE, `the rights are normally exercisable but are temporarily incapable of exercise` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- ordinary rights: paragraph 4 is silent
#ASSERT (`sch 6 para 4 the rights are taken into account` WITH `the rights are exercisable only in certain circumstances` IS FALSE, `the circumstances have arisen and continue to obtain` IS FALSE, `the circumstances are within the control of the person having the rights` IS FALSE, `the rights are normally exercisable but are temporarily incapable of exercise` IS FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
-- conditional rights, not yet arisen, not in the holder's control, and temporarily incapable: sub-paragraph (1) governs
#ASSERT (`sch 6 para 4 the rights are taken into account` WITH `the rights are exercisable only in certain circumstances` IS TRUE, `the circumstances have arisen and continue to obtain` IS FALSE, `the circumstances are within the control of the person having the rights` IS FALSE, `the rights are normally exercisable but are temporarily incapable of exercise` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE

§§ `Paras 5 and 6: rights held on behalf of another`

-- para 5: held in a fiduciary capacity
#ASSERT (`sch 6 para 5 the rights are treated as not held by the person who holds them` WITH `the rights are held in a fiduciary capacity` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- para 5: not held in a fiduciary capacity (limited by its own wording)
#ASSERT (`sch 6 para 5 the rights are treated as not held by the person who holds them` WITH `the rights are held in a fiduciary capacity` IS FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
-- para 6(2): exercisable only on his instructions or with his consent or concurrence
#ASSERT (`sch 6 para 6(2) the rights are regarded as held as nominee for another` WITH `the rights are exercisable only on his instructions or with his consent or concurrence` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- para 6(2): not so exercisable (an unmet 'if': marginal reading (a))
#ASSERT (`sch 6 para 6(2) the rights are regarded as held as nominee for another` WITH `the rights are exercisable only on his instructions or with his consent or concurrence` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- para 6(1): held by a person as nominee for another
#ASSERT (`sch 6 para 6(1) the rights are treated as held by the other` WITH `the rights are held by a person as nominee for another` IS TRUE, `the rights are regarded as held as nominee for another under paragraph 6(2)` IS NOTHING) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- para 6(1): regarded as held as nominee under para 6(2)
#ASSERT (`sch 6 para 6(1) the rights are treated as held by the other` WITH `the rights are held by a person as nominee for another` IS FALSE, `the rights are regarded as held as nominee for another under paragraph 6(2)` IS JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- para 6(1): neither a nominee nor regarded as one
#ASSERT (`sch 6 para 6(1) the rights are treated as held by the other` WITH `the rights are held by a person as nominee for another` IS FALSE, `the rights are regarded as held as nominee for another under paragraph 6(2)` IS JUST FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
-- para 6(1): not a nominee; para 6(2) not decided
#ASSERT (`sch 6 para 6(1) the rights are treated as held by the other` WITH `the rights are held by a person as nominee for another` IS FALSE, `the rights are regarded as held as nominee for another under paragraph 6(2)` IS NOTHING) EQUALS NOTHING

§§ `Paras 7 and 8: security; rights attributed to a holding company`

-- Para 8(3): exercisable in accordance with the instructions or interests of (a) any subsidiary or holding company of that company or (b) any subsidiary of a holding company of that company.
-- limb (a)
#ASSERT (`sch 6 para 8(3) the rights are treated as exercisable in accordance with the instructions or in the interests of the company` WITH `the rights are exercisable in accordance with the instructions of, or in the interests of, any subsidiary or holding company of that company` IS TRUE, `the rights are exercisable in accordance with the instructions of, or in the interests of, any subsidiary of a holding company of that company` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- limb (b)
#ASSERT (`sch 6 para 8(3) the rights are treated as exercisable in accordance with the instructions or in the interests of the company` WITH `the rights are exercisable in accordance with the instructions of, or in the interests of, any subsidiary or holding company of that company` IS FALSE, `the rights are exercisable in accordance with the instructions of, or in the interests of, any subsidiary of a holding company of that company` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- neither limb (an unmet 'if': marginal reading (a))
#ASSERT (`sch 6 para 8(3) the rights are treated as exercisable in accordance with the instructions or in the interests of the company` WITH `the rights are exercisable in accordance with the instructions of, or in the interests of, any subsidiary or holding company of that company` IS FALSE, `the rights are exercisable in accordance with the instructions of, or in the interests of, any subsidiary of a holding company of that company` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Para 7: shares held by way of security: the rights are treated as held by the person providing it (a) where, apart from the right to preserve or realise the security, the rights are exercisable only in accordance with his instructions, and (b) where the shares are held in connection with the granting of loans as part of normal business activities and the rights are exercisable only in his interests. Para 8(3) widens 'his' to his group.
-- security; instructions of the provider; loans in normal business; interests of the provider
#ASSERT (`sch 6 para 7 the rights are treated as held by the person providing the security` WITH `the shares are held by way of security` IS TRUE, `apart from the right to exercise them for the purpose of preserving the value of the security, or of realising it, the rights are exercisable only in accordance with the instructions of the person providing the security` IS TRUE, `apart from that right, the rights are exercisable only in accordance with the instructions of a subsidiary or holding company of the person providing the security, or of a subsidiary of a holding company of that person` IS FALSE, `the shares are held in connection with the granting of loans as part of normal business activities` IS TRUE, `apart from that right, the rights are exercisable only in the interests of the person providing the security` IS TRUE, `apart from that right, the rights are exercisable only in the interests of a subsidiary or holding company of the person providing the security, or of a subsidiary of a holding company of that person` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- security; instructions and interests of a company in the provider's group (para 8(3)); loans
#ASSERT (`sch 6 para 7 the rights are treated as held by the person providing the security` WITH `the shares are held by way of security` IS TRUE, `apart from the right to exercise them for the purpose of preserving the value of the security, or of realising it, the rights are exercisable only in accordance with the instructions of the person providing the security` IS FALSE, `apart from that right, the rights are exercisable only in accordance with the instructions of a subsidiary or holding company of the person providing the security, or of a subsidiary of a holding company of that person` IS TRUE, `the shares are held in connection with the granting of loans as part of normal business activities` IS TRUE, `apart from that right, the rights are exercisable only in the interests of the person providing the security` IS FALSE, `apart from that right, the rights are exercisable only in the interests of a subsidiary or holding company of the person providing the security, or of a subsidiary of a holding company of that person` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- security; instructions of the provider and interests of a group company (a mix); loans
#ASSERT (`sch 6 para 7 the rights are treated as held by the person providing the security` WITH `the shares are held by way of security` IS TRUE, `apart from the right to exercise them for the purpose of preserving the value of the security, or of realising it, the rights are exercisable only in accordance with the instructions of the person providing the security` IS TRUE, `apart from that right, the rights are exercisable only in accordance with the instructions of a subsidiary or holding company of the person providing the security, or of a subsidiary of a holding company of that person` IS FALSE, `the shares are held in connection with the granting of loans as part of normal business activities` IS TRUE, `apart from that right, the rights are exercisable only in the interests of the person providing the security` IS FALSE, `apart from that right, the rights are exercisable only in the interests of a subsidiary or holding company of the person providing the security, or of a subsidiary of a holding company of that person` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- security; not held in connection with loans as part of normal business activities
#ASSERT (`sch 6 para 7 the rights are treated as held by the person providing the security` WITH `the shares are held by way of security` IS TRUE, `apart from the right to exercise them for the purpose of preserving the value of the security, or of realising it, the rights are exercisable only in accordance with the instructions of the person providing the security` IS TRUE, `apart from that right, the rights are exercisable only in accordance with the instructions of a subsidiary or holding company of the person providing the security, or of a subsidiary of a holding company of that person` IS FALSE, `the shares are held in connection with the granting of loans as part of normal business activities` IS FALSE, `apart from that right, the rights are exercisable only in the interests of the person providing the security` IS TRUE, `apart from that right, the rights are exercisable only in the interests of a subsidiary or holding company of the person providing the security, or of a subsidiary of a holding company of that person` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- security; loans; not exercisable only in the provider's instructions (or his group's)
#ASSERT (`sch 6 para 7 the rights are treated as held by the person providing the security` WITH `the shares are held by way of security` IS TRUE, `apart from the right to exercise them for the purpose of preserving the value of the security, or of realising it, the rights are exercisable only in accordance with the instructions of the person providing the security` IS FALSE, `apart from that right, the rights are exercisable only in accordance with the instructions of a subsidiary or holding company of the person providing the security, or of a subsidiary of a holding company of that person` IS FALSE, `the shares are held in connection with the granting of loans as part of normal business activities` IS TRUE, `apart from that right, the rights are exercisable only in the interests of the person providing the security` IS TRUE, `apart from that right, the rights are exercisable only in the interests of a subsidiary or holding company of the person providing the security, or of a subsidiary of a holding company of that person` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- security; loans; not exercisable only in the provider's interests (or his group's)
#ASSERT (`sch 6 para 7 the rights are treated as held by the person providing the security` WITH `the shares are held by way of security` IS TRUE, `apart from the right to exercise them for the purpose of preserving the value of the security, or of realising it, the rights are exercisable only in accordance with the instructions of the person providing the security` IS TRUE, `apart from that right, the rights are exercisable only in accordance with the instructions of a subsidiary or holding company of the person providing the security, or of a subsidiary of a holding company of that person` IS FALSE, `the shares are held in connection with the granting of loans as part of normal business activities` IS TRUE, `apart from that right, the rights are exercisable only in the interests of the person providing the security` IS FALSE, `apart from that right, the rights are exercisable only in the interests of a subsidiary or holding company of the person providing the security, or of a subsidiary of a holding company of that person` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- not held by way of security: para 7 does not speak to it
#ASSERT (`sch 6 para 7 the rights are treated as held by the person providing the security` WITH `the shares are held by way of security` IS FALSE, `apart from the right to exercise them for the purpose of preserving the value of the security, or of realising it, the rights are exercisable only in accordance with the instructions of the person providing the security` IS TRUE, `apart from that right, the rights are exercisable only in accordance with the instructions of a subsidiary or holding company of the person providing the security, or of a subsidiary of a holding company of that person` IS FALSE, `the shares are held in connection with the granting of loans as part of normal business activities` IS TRUE, `apart from that right, the rights are exercisable only in the interests of the person providing the security` IS TRUE, `apart from that right, the rights are exercisable only in the interests of a subsidiary or holding company of the person providing the security, or of a subsidiary of a holding company of that person` IS FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
-- para 8(1): held by a subsidiary company of the holding company
#ASSERT (`sch 6 para 8(1) the rights are treated as held by the holding company` WITH `the rights are held by a subsidiary company of the holding company` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- para 8(1): not held by a subsidiary (an unmet 'if': marginal reading (a))
#ASSERT (`sch 6 para 8(1) the rights are treated as held by the holding company` WITH `the rights are held by a subsidiary company of the holding company` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- para 8(2): rights held by a holding company, the attribution would be to its subsidiary: no (a flat negative)
#ASSERT (`sch 6 para 8(2) paragraph 6 or 7 requires the rights held by the holding company to be treated as held by its subsidiary` WITH `the rights are held by a holding company` IS TRUE, `the person to whom paragraph 6 or 7 would attribute them is a subsidiary of that holding company` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- para 8(2): the rights are not a holding company's
#ASSERT (`sch 6 para 8(2) paragraph 6 or 7 requires the rights held by the holding company to be treated as held by its subsidiary` WITH `the rights are held by a holding company` IS FALSE, `the person to whom paragraph 6 or 7 would attribute them is a subsidiary of that holding company` IS TRUE) EQUALS NOTHING
-- para 8(2): the person is not its subsidiary
#ASSERT (`sch 6 para 8(2) paragraph 6 or 7 requires the rights held by the holding company to be treated as held by its subsidiary` WITH `the rights are held by a holding company` IS TRUE, `the person to whom paragraph 6 or 7 would attribute them is a subsidiary of that holding company` IS FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING

§§ `Paras 9 and 10: disregard of certain rights; supplementary`

-- 100 voting rights, the company holds 10 itself: reduced to 90
#ASSERT (`sch 6 para 9 the voting rights in the company after the reduction` WITH `the voting rights in the company` IS 100, `the rights held by the company itself` IS 10) EQUALS JUST 90
-- the company holds none of its own
#ASSERT (`sch 6 para 9 the voting rights in the company after the reduction` WITH `the voting rights in the company` IS 100, `the rights held by the company itself` IS 0) EQUALS JUST 100
-- the company holds all of them
#ASSERT (`sch 6 para 9 the voting rights in the company after the reduction` WITH `the voting rights in the company` IS 100, `the rights held by the company itself` IS 100) EQUALS JUST 0
-- the company holds more than there are: not decided
#ASSERT (`sch 6 para 9 the voting rights in the company after the reduction` WITH `the voting rights in the company` IS 100, `the rights held by the company itself` IS 101) EQUALS NOTHING
-- rights falling to be treated as held by him by another provision
#ASSERT (`sch 6 para 10 the rights are rights held by the person for the purposes of paragraphs 5 to 9` WITH `the rights are held by the person` IS FALSE, `the rights fall to be treated as held by him by virtue of another provision of paragraphs 5 to 9` IS TRUE, `the rights are to be treated as not held by him by virtue of another provision of paragraphs 5 to 9` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- rights to be treated as not held by him by another provision ('but not')
#ASSERT (`sch 6 para 10 the rights are rights held by the person for the purposes of paragraphs 5 to 9` WITH `the rights are held by the person` IS FALSE, `the rights fall to be treated as held by him by virtue of another provision of paragraphs 5 to 9` IS FALSE, `the rights are to be treated as not held by him by virtue of another provision of paragraphs 5 to 9` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- treated as held by one provision but as not held by another: 'but not' wins
#ASSERT (`sch 6 para 10 the rights are rights held by the person for the purposes of paragraphs 5 to 9` WITH `the rights are held by the person` IS FALSE, `the rights fall to be treated as held by him by virtue of another provision of paragraphs 5 to 9` IS TRUE, `the rights are to be treated as not held by him by virtue of another provision of paragraphs 5 to 9` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- an ordinary holding only: paragraph 10 is about rights treated as held (includes)
#ASSERT (`sch 6 para 10 the rights are rights held by the person for the purposes of paragraphs 5 to 9` WITH `the rights are held by the person` IS TRUE, `the rights fall to be treated as held by him by virtue of another provision of paragraphs 5 to 9` IS FALSE, `the rights are to be treated as not held by him by virtue of another provision of paragraphs 5 to 9` IS FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING

§§ `One block of rights, seen from the other company (paras 4 to 10 together)`

-- Held beneficially: the other company's own rights count (s 1159(1)(a)); a subsidiary's count by para 8(1); a third party's are not attributed.
-- beneficial, the other company
#ASSERT (`sch 6 paras 4 to 10 the rights are treated as held by the other company` WITH `who holds the rights` IS `sch 6 the other company itself`, `how the rights are held` IS `sch 6 held beneficially`, `the result of sch 6 para 4` IS NOTHING, `the result of sch 6 para 7` IS NOTHING) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- beneficial, its subsidiary (para 8(1))
#ASSERT (`sch 6 paras 4 to 10 the rights are treated as held by the other company` WITH `who holds the rights` IS `sch 6 a subsidiary company of the other company`, `how the rights are held` IS `sch 6 held beneficially`, `the result of sch 6 para 4` IS NOTHING, `the result of sch 6 para 7` IS NOTHING) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- beneficial, someone else
#ASSERT (`sch 6 paras 4 to 10 the rights are treated as held by the other company` WITH `who holds the rights` IS `sch 6 someone else`, `how the rights are held` IS `sch 6 held beneficially`, `the result of sch 6 para 4` IS NOTHING, `the result of sch 6 para 7` IS NOTHING) EQUALS NOTHING
-- Para 5: held in a fiduciary capacity: treated as not held by the holder; and by para 10 not counted through para 8(1) either.
-- fiduciary, the other company
#ASSERT (`sch 6 paras 4 to 10 the rights are treated as held by the other company` WITH `who holds the rights` IS `sch 6 the other company itself`, `how the rights are held` IS `sch 6 held in a fiduciary capacity`, `the result of sch 6 para 4` IS NOTHING, `the result of sch 6 para 7` IS NOTHING) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- fiduciary, its subsidiary
#ASSERT (`sch 6 paras 4 to 10 the rights are treated as held by the other company` WITH `who holds the rights` IS `sch 6 a subsidiary company of the other company`, `how the rights are held` IS `sch 6 held in a fiduciary capacity`, `the result of sch 6 para 4` IS NOTHING, `the result of sch 6 para 7` IS NOTHING) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- fiduciary, someone else
#ASSERT (`sch 6 paras 4 to 10 the rights are treated as held by the other company` WITH `who holds the rights` IS `sch 6 someone else`, `how the rights are held` IS `sch 6 held in a fiduciary capacity`, `the result of sch 6 para 4` IS NOTHING, `the result of sch 6 para 7` IS NOTHING) EQUALS NOTHING
-- Para 6(1): held as nominee for another is treated as held by the other.
-- nominee for the other company, held by someone else
#ASSERT (`sch 6 paras 4 to 10 the rights are treated as held by the other company` WITH `who holds the rights` IS `sch 6 someone else`, `how the rights are held` IS `sch 6 held as nominee for the other company`, `the result of sch 6 para 4` IS NOTHING, `the result of sch 6 para 7` IS NOTHING) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- nominee for the other company, held by its subsidiary
#ASSERT (`sch 6 paras 4 to 10 the rights are treated as held by the other company` WITH `who holds the rights` IS `sch 6 a subsidiary company of the other company`, `how the rights are held` IS `sch 6 held as nominee for the other company`, `the result of sch 6 para 4` IS NOTHING, `the result of sch 6 para 7` IS NOTHING) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- nominee for someone else, held by the other company
#ASSERT (`sch 6 paras 4 to 10 the rights are treated as held by the other company` WITH `who holds the rights` IS `sch 6 the other company itself`, `how the rights are held` IS `sch 6 held as nominee for someone else`, `the result of sch 6 para 4` IS NOTHING, `the result of sch 6 para 7` IS NOTHING) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- nominee for someone else, held by its subsidiary
